 "remarks": "Waterfront Views, Resort Amenities & Unmatched Vacation Vibe in Norwalk's Harborview. Enjoy Long Island Sound views and sea breezes in this elevated, FEMA-compliant Colonial on a private corner lot just steps from the shoreline. Completely remodeled for effortless modern living, it blends coastal charm with move-in-ready peace of mind. The sun-drenched main level features an expansive living room with coffered ceilings and a wood-burning fireplace, flowing into a generous dining area. The oversized chef's kitchen boasts a Pietra Cardosa stone island, Viking double range, and custom Swedish pantry. Glass doors open to a private backyard oasis with a deck, lush landscaping, and an in-ground pool. Offering true main-level living, the first floor includes a primary suite with en-suite bath and dressing room, a window-wrapped corner office, mudroom with laundry, and a flexible guest room with full bath. A separate front entrance leads to a private studio with half bath and laundry-ideal for an in-law suite, au pair quarters, home business, or ADU. Upstairs offers three bedrooms, a full bath, & expansion potential over the first-floor footprint. The elevated lower level houses a rare two-car garage & abundant storage. Enjoy community perks including a waterfront clubhouse, tennis, ball field, playground, and Norwalk Harbor access for swimming, kayaking, and paddleboarding. Just 2 miles to Metro-North (1 hr to Grand Central) and minutes to I-95, The SONO Collection, and SONO dining.",
